{"author":{"id":"8d2e0405f08ac6c481f912544d6d5c0f58b2dc14a7e51ad4d499ee7a34567943"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794994444,"nonce":"3DBpW+SDHJpHTO2YOAA/iuU98Sg=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDORPa0Bs8AAAABgUrZ0g","github-url":"https://github.com/FhG-IISB/jNO/issues/201","origin":"github"},"title":"fem: a complex essential (Dirichlet) value is refused","message":"`jno.fem` refuses an essential condition whose value is complex. A sound-soft scatterer (`u_s = -exp(i k x)` on the obstacle) or any prescribed complex trace therefore cannot be written as a term; the user has to build a lift by hand and move it into the source.\n\nReproduced on release 0.4.2 and on `main` (b3dcdd22).\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```python\nimport jax\njax.config.update(\"jax_enable_x64\", True)\nimport jno\n\nK = 5.0\nd = jno.shape.rect(0, 0, 1, 1, size=0.1).domain()\nu, phi = d.fem_symbols()\nxi, yi, _ = d.variable(\"interior\", split=True)\nxb, yb, _ = d.variable(\"boundary\", split=True)\nui, vi = u.bind(x=xi, y=yi), phi.bind(x=xi, y=yi)\ndamping = 1.0 + 0.1j  # makes the form complex\nfem = jno.fem([ui.x * vi.x + ui.y * vi.y - K**2 * damping * (ui * vi), u(xb, yb) - jno.np.exp(1j * K * xb)])\nfem.solve()\n```\n\n```\nNotImplementedError: jno.fem: a COMPLEX essential value on region 'boundary' is not supported — a complex form's\nRe/Im legs share one Dirichlet row set, which can impose Re u = g with Im u = 0 but not a prescribed Im u. Use a\nreal essential value and carry the complex part in the operator or the source.\n```\n\nThe refusal is clear and by name, which is right. The request is the feature.\n\n## Possible route\n\nA complex problem is already solved as its fused real block over `[x_r; x_i]`. The two legs could carry their own essential values (`Re g` on the real rows, `Im g` on the imaginary rows) instead of sharing one row set.","files":null}]}